OL,3,ATrump announces deal with Putin to
OL,4,Arelease Russian diesel
OL,5,
OL,6,FDiesel prices in the US have doubled
OL,7,Fsince the war with Iran began in
OL,8,FFebruary, putting pressure on
OL,9,FRepublicans ahead of the midterm
OL,10,Felections over the rising cost of
OL,11,Fliving.
